                                "sense_id": "e52df8f6-2d01-3da6-88be-f694c45d5e20",
                                "text": "Those things […] about which he was wont to have long parleyings and disputings with his own conscience — employing carnal reason to invent arguments and pleas of excuse — he now sticks at no longer […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed81f435-d0c4-4ba1-8ed7-529c917edb15",
                                "sense_id": "e52df8f6-2d01-3da6-88be-f694c45d5e20",
                                "text": "He and Colonel Rotton, who was also Chairman for a period, could generally make the lads on arrival understand them without much parleying."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
